rker itself. When that marker is removed, the model still has access to the meaningful exception information through the empty or minimal exception fields, so performance should remain consistently high across different random seeds.\n\nFor CodeLlama-13B with VOTA, I'm estimating somewhere in the 92-95% range for the best tier. The model is larger than DeepSeek but from a different family, and while it should handle execution reasoning better than smaller models, it won't match the exception-only baseline since VOTA requires more complex reasoning. Given that DeepSeek achieved 84.45% on VOTA, CodeLlama-13B's additional capacity should push it higher within that 84-96% best tier window.\n\nNow I'm generating the YAML output...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34524,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34524},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59100ba3-d6d0-4fb3-883a-d85f45e882f8","uuid":"bcd0c029-7ffa-4174-9ceb-41b5214f54d9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019FKt7FsG2aRFqiMSLY1XTK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"原始 framing 完全成立。所有 pending 实验完美确认：exception signal 有效性来自 fault semantics 而非 format shortcut，跨 4 models × 3 families × 2 scales 验证一致。Title: 'Exception Events Are All You Need for Verdict Prediction'。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"移除 '[No exception data in trace]' 格式标记后重训 exception_only，seed42\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9958\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 1.0\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 2\n      error_ids: [901, 905]\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.9976\n      pass_f1: 0.9988\n      fail_precision: 0.9941\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.9971\n      train_loss: 0.112\n      eval_loss: 0.48\n    result_rationale: \"模型从未依赖 '[No exception data in trace]' 作为 pass 分类的 shortcut。原因：(1) fail 样本包含丰富的 exception 语义信息（ERROR type: XxxError, message: ...），模型学到的是'有具体异常内容→fail'的 fault detection 映射；(2) pass 样本在移除 marker 后变为空或极短的 trace（无异常内容），'缺乏异常语义内容'本身就是充分的 pass signal，无需特定格式字符串；(3) Regex B5 分析已证明纯格式标记能达 99.33%，但 SFT 的额外 0.50pp 恰好来自模型对 GeneratorExit 语义的部分理解——这种语义学习在移除 marker 后完全保留；(4) 2 个 irreducible errors (id=901,905, GeneratorExit) 是 representation 固有限制，与 marker 无关，在所有 seeds 中必然复现。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"nomarker vs original comparison\"\n        data: |\n          | Condition | Seed 42 | Seed 123 | Seed 456 | Mean | Std |\n          |-----------|---------|----------|----------|------|-----|\n          | exception_only (original) | 99.83% | 99.83% | 99.83% | 99.83% | 0.00 |\n          | exception_only (nomarker) | 99.83% | 99.83% | 99.83% | 99.83% | 0.00 |\n          | Δ (nomarker - original) | 0.00pp | 0.00pp | 0.00pp | 0.00pp | — |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: nomarker 3-seed accuracy 与 original 3-seed accuracy 完全重叠，均为 99.83%。Error bars 显示 Wilson CI [99.58%, 100%]。视觉上两组无法区分。\"\n    analysis: \"McNemar test p=1.0（无差异）。3 seeds 错误样本与 original 完全相同（id=901, 905），确认模型未使用 format marker 作为分类依据。这直接证伪 'pattern matching [No exception data in trace]' 的 reviewer concern：模型学到的是 exception fault semantics，format marker 是冗余信号。\"\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"移除格式标记后重训 exception_only，seed123\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9958\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 1.0\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 2\n      error_ids: [901, 905]\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.9976\n      pass_f1: 0.9988\n      fail_precision: 0.9941\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.9971\n      train_loss: 0.110\n      eval_loss: 0.47\n    result_rationale: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B 在 exception_only 条件下对 LoRA 初始化完全不敏感（original 3 seeds variance=0），这种 robustness 源自 exception signal 的结构简单性——映射空间极小（有异常内容→fail，无异常内容→pass），任何合理的 LoRA 初始化都能在 3 epochs 内收敛到相同的 decision boundary。移除 format marker 不改变这一结构：pass 样本仍然是'无异常语义内容'，信息量与 marker 版本等价。seed123 在 Qwen 上无 DeepSeek 式的 LoRA 不稳定性。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"与 seed42 和 seed456 结果完全一致，进一步确认 Qwen exception_only 的完美 seed robustness 在移除 format marker 后保持不变。\"\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"移除格式标记后重训 exception_only，seed456\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9958\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 1.0\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 2\n      error_ids: [901, 905]\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.9976\n      pass_f1: 0.9988\n      fail_precision: 0.9941\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.9971\n      train_loss: 0.109\n      eval_loss: 0.46\n    result_rationale: \"同 seed42/123 逻辑。3 seeds 完美一致性的预测基于：(1) original exception_only 在 Qwen 上 3 seeds variance=0 已建立 precedent；(2) 移除 marker 不改变有效信息量——fail 样本的 exception content 完整保留，pass 样本的'无内容'信号同样明确；(3) 2 个 irreducible errors 是 data/representation 属性（GeneratorExit），完全独立于 LoRA 初始化和 format marker presence。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"3-seed 汇总统计：mean=99.83%, std=0.00, worst=99.83%。与 original exception_only 3-seed 统计完全相同。这是本文回应 'format shortcut' concern 的决定性证据。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA trace SFT，验证 VOTA 跨第三模型家族表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9294\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.914\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.944\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.93\n      pass_recall: 0.98\n      pass_f1: 0.955\n      fail_precision: 0.93\n      fail_recall: 0.80\n      fail_f1: 0.86\n      train_loss: 0.058\n      eval_loss: 0.12\n      epoch_level:\n        epoch1_accuracy: 0.905\n        epoch3_accuracy: 0.9294\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B VOTA 预测在 Qwen (99.41%) 和 DeepSeek (84.45%) 之间偏上，原因：(1) 13B 参数量提供更强的 execution reasoning capacity（VOTA 的 loop compression 组件需要理解迭代行为），相比 6.7B DeepSeek 有显著优势；(2) 但 LLaMA-based architecture 的 code reasoning 能力弱于 Qwen-2.5-Coder（后者在 code-specific pretraining 上投入更大），VOTA 中 Tier 2 组件的利用效率不及 Qwen；(3) CodeLlama 的 tokenizer 对 VOTA 格式的 token efficiency 可能介于两者之间——部分训练样本仍可能被截断但比率低于 DeepSeek 的 91.7%（13B 模型 context 处理更好，且 LLaMA tokenizer 可能对 trace 格式更紧凑）；(4) 最关键：VOTA accuracy 92.94% < exception_only 99.83%，确认 exception dominance 在第三模型家族成立，cross_family_exception_dominance = 6.89pp。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-family VOTA comparison\"\n        data: |\n          | Model | Family | Scale | VOTA | exception_only | Δ (exc - VOTA) |\n          |-------|--------|-------|------|----------------|----------------|\n          | Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B | Qwen | 7B | 99.41% | 99.83% | +0.42pp |\n          | Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B | Qwen | 1.5B | 99.58% | 99.83% | +0.25pp |\n          | DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B | DeepSeek | 6.7B | 84.45% | 99.33% | +14.88pp |\n          | CodeLlama-13B-Instruct | LLaMA | 13B | 92.94% | 99.83% | +6.89pp |\n      - name: \"Exception dominance across all 4 models\"\n        data: |\n          | Model | exception_only | Best non-exception | Dominance (pp) |\n          |-------|---------------|-------------------|----------------|\n          | Qwen-7B | 99.83% | 99.41% (VOTA) | +0.42 |\n          | Qwen-1.5B | 99.83% | 99.58% (VOTA) | +0.25 |\n          | DeepSeek-6.7B | 99.33% | 84.45% (VOTA) | +14.88 |\n          | CodeLlama-13B | 99.83% | 92.94% (VOTA) | +6.89 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 4 models × (exception_only, VOTA, no_trace)。所有模型 exception_only 柱子在 99-100% 区间密集分布，VOTA 柱子呈现明显的 model-dependent spread (84-99%)，no_trace 柱子在 67-77% 范围。视觉上 exception_only 是唯一跨模型一致的 condition。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=model execution reasoning proxy (CRUXEval-I or similar), y=VOTA accuracy。3 点近似线性关系（DeepSeek 39%→84.45%, CodeLlama ~48%→92.94%, Qwen 56.5%→99.41%），而 exception_only 作为 horizontal reference line 在 99.83% 不随 x 变化。\"\n    analysis: \"CodeLlama-13B 确认 exception > VOTA 的层级关系在第三个模型家族（LLaMA）成立。VOTA gap 的 model-dependency pattern 更加清晰：execution reasoning 能力越弱的模型，VOTA degradation 越大（因为 VOTA 包含需要 reasoning 的 Tier 2 loop 组件）。Exception signal 因结构简单性完全绕过这一 bottleneck——4 models × 3 families × 2 scales 均达到 99.83%（除 DeepSeek seed-dependent 外），构成 'universally dominant' 的最强证据。cross_family_exception_dominance 在 0.25pp 到 14.88pp 之间，mean=5.61pp，所有方向一致。overall_model_count_supporting_claim1 = 4/4。\"\n\n  - name: \"nomarker_3seed_summary\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"plan_015 三 seed 汇总分析——format independence 证据\"\n    expected_results:\n      nomarker_accuracy_3seed_mean: 0.9983\n      nomarker_accuracy_worst_seed: 0.9983\n      nomarker_accuracy_std: 0.0\n      nomarker_vs_original_mcnemar_p: 1.0\n      nomarker_error_overlap_with_original: 1.0\n      format_contribution_to_accuracy: 0.0\n    result_rationale: \"3-seed nomarker 与 original 结果完全相同，提供 format independence 的决定性证据。逻辑链：(1) Regex B5（纯 format marker 匹配）达 99.33%，说明 format marker 确实是 strong feature；(2) 但 SFT 模型在移除该 feature 后性能不降（99.83%→99.83%），说明模型学到了比 format marker 更深的 representation——即 exception 语义内容本身；(3) SFT 比 regex B5 高 0.50pp 的 gap 恰好是 irreducible error 分析所解释的：regex 无法处理的 edge cases（如部分 GeneratorExit 在 regex 中被误判）由 SFT 通过上下文理解部分修正，但 2 个 truly irreducible 的 GeneratorExit 仍无法解决；(4) 这证明 exception_only SFT 的 contribution 不是 'learned a format shortcut' 而是 'learned fault semantics that happen to correlate with but are not reducible to format markers'。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Format shortcut 证伪证据链\"\n        data: |\n          | Evidence | Value | Interpretation |\n          |----------|-------|----------------|\n          | Regex B5 (format marker only) | 99.33% | Format marker IS a strong feature |\n          | SFT original (with marker) | 99.83% | SFT > regex by 0.50pp |\n          | SFT nomarker (without marker) | 99.83% | Removing marker → no degradation |\n          | SFT - Regex gap | +0.50pp | SFT learned something beyond format |\n          | nomarker - original gap | 0.00pp | That 'something' is not the marker itself |\n          | Irreducible errors (both conditions) | 2/1190 | Same GeneratorExit samples |\n          | Conclusion | — | Model learns exception fault semantics, not format pattern |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×3 confusion matrix comparison: nomarker vs original, 3 seeds。所有 6 个 confusion matrices 完全相同（TP=851, TN=337, FP=0, FN=2）。视觉上证明 format marker removal 对模型 decision boundary 无任何影响。\"\n    analysis: \"这是 best tier 的核心证据之一。论文可以 confidently claim：'The model's near-perfect performance stems from learning exception fault semantics — the presence and content of error events — rather than format-level shortcuts such as the absence/presence of a specific marker string.' 配合 irreducible error 分析（2/1190 = GeneratorExit, representation ceiling）和 regex baseline gap（0.50pp = semantic understanding beyond pattern matching），三条证据链收敛于同一结论：exception_only SFT 实现了 genuine fault detection，非 trivial feature engineering。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34524,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34524},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59100ba3-d6d0-4fb3-883a-d85f45e882f8","uuid":"372ed23f-9718-4d10-832c-e38c4a4b169e"}
